; UnifiedTrader_EA - GoldTrader preset
; Chart > EA Inputs > Load. Then fill in InpBotToken, InpControlChatId and
; InpChannelId1 (2/3) - see GoldTrader/README.md.
;
; Ships with BOTH sources on (Telegram signals + managing Claude's trades)
; and InpDryRun=true (nothing is sent until you set it false). Everything
; here already matches GoldTrader/app/config.py: magic numbers, $6 SL /
; $6 TP1 lock / $3 trail at 0.01 reference lot, 2% risk, 10% daily cap,
; 5 per direction, and the shared file names. InpXtrExportCopyTo: your
; Google Drive folder (check the exact path in Explorer - Google's default
; is G:\My Drive\...); empty = keep the price files in MT5's Common\Files.
;
; InpExitStyle applies to InpClaudeMagicNumber positions ONLY (Telegram-
; sourced positions always use plain lock-then-trail) - 0 is EXIT_SL_TO_TP1
; (the default, matches AdvisorConfig.exit_style="sl_to_tp1"). Set it to 1
; (EXIT_BREAKEVEN_R_DECAY) only if AdvisorConfig.exit_style is also
; "breakeven_r_decay" - see config.py's module docstring - and keep
; InpBreakevenAtrMult/InpAtrPeriod/InpDecayWindowMinutes in sync with
; breakeven_atr_mult/breakeven_atr_period/decay_window_minutes there by
; hand. InpAtrTimeframe=5 is PERIOD_M5 (MT5's raw ENUM_TIMEFRAMES value).
;
; InpControlChatId=0 (default) disables remote control entirely. Set it to
; your own DM chat id with this bot (never the signal channel's) to enable
; PauseHab/ResumeHab/PauseTelHab/ResumeTelHab/PauseClaudeHab/ResumeClaudeHab/
; Why - see the .mq5 file
; header's REMOTE CONTROL section. Needs InpBotToken set even if
; InpEnableTelegramSignals is false. InpLastVerdictFilename (Why button)
; MUST match GoldTrader/app/config.py's
; AdvisorConfig.last_verdict_filename, and InpClaudePauseFilename (how
; PauseClaudeHab/ResumeClaudeHab reach app/main.py) MUST match
; AdvisorConfig.claude_pause_filename.
;
InpEnableTelegramSignals=true
InpEnableClaudeManagement=true
InpFixedLot=0.01
InpReferenceLot=0.01
InpUseRiskPercent=true
InpRiskPercent=2.0
InpMaxLotSize=5.0
InpMaxPositionsPerDirection=5
InpSlDollars=6.0
InpTp1Dollars=6.0
InpTrailDollars=3.0
InpTelegramMagicNumber=20260922
InpClaudeMagicNumber=20260921
InpDryRun=true
InpExitStyle=0
InpBreakevenAtrMult=0.5
InpAtrTimeframe=5
InpAtrPeriod=14
InpDecayWindowMinutes=15.0
InpBotToken=
InpChannelId1=0
InpChannelId2=0
InpChannelId3=0
InpMaxMessageChars=400
InpMaxCommandChars=60
InpAcceptPhotoCaptions=false
InpLogSkippedMessages=false
InpPollSeconds=5
InpHttpTimeoutMs=5000
InpMaxSignalAgeSec=180
InpTradeXAUUSDOnly=true
InpMaxTradesPerDay=0
InpMaxDailyLossPct=10.0
InpMaxSpreadPoints=50
InpMarginGuard=true
InpPendingExpiryMin=240
InpMaxEntryDeviationPips=200.0
InpControlChatId=0
InpLastVerdictFilename=claudesmc_last_verdict.txt
InpClaudePauseFilename=claudesmc_pause.txt
InpNotifyTradeClosed=true
InpXtrHtfFilter=true
InpXtrHtf1=15
InpXtrHtf2=16385
InpNewsFilter=true
InpNewsCurrencies=USD
InpNewsMinImportance=3
InpNewsBlockBeforeMin=15
InpNewsBlockAfterMin=15
InpCalendarExportFile=econ_calendar.csv
InpCalendarRefreshMin=5
InpXtrExport=true
InpXtrExportFolder=XTR_Data
InpXtrExportName=XAUUSD
InpXtrExportBars=200
InpXtrExportM1=false
InpXtrExportCopyTo=G:\MyDrive\MyMQChartDrive
